 its blue flame aura flaring outward. [Shot 2] At 00:02.000, the camera cuts to a low-angle side shot. The swordsman twists his waist and swings the glowing katana in a wide horizontal arc, the blade trailing a ribbon of blue light, and in the same instant the demon phantom mirrors his motion, hurling its massive clawed arm forward in a synchronized strike. The camera trucks right with small amplitude at fast speed, following the swing as the blue spectral flames surge into a crescent shockwave. [Shot 3] At 00:04.000, the camera cuts to a wide frontal shot. The combined slash is unleashed: the swordsman completes his follow-through with the blade fully extended, while the demon phantom lunges past his shoulder, its claw and the roaring blue energy wave rushing toward the camera as embers and flame scatter violently. The camera shakes strongly as the shockwave engulfs the frame, ending on the swordsman's extended cutting pose with the phantom's silhouette stretched out behind him.\\n\\noverall_soundscape: A deep demonic roar rolls over the crackle of rising flames and the charged hum of the blade. The swing produces a sharp whoosh followed by a roaring energy blast, scattering embers and rumbling the ground.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music: Heavy taiko drums and a fast low-string ostinato at a driving tempo, swelling with brass stabs at the strike and cutting to a sustained low drone at the end.\",\"negativePrompt\":\"\",\"taskType\":\"\",\"refs\":[],\"refAudios\":[],\"refVideos\":[],\"genImage\":{\"imageFile\":\"1f544534d332e0cb5e600f8477aed8d87a2085790fb4879588c7ab12bceb76eb.jpg\",\"fileName\":\"\"}}],\"timelineMode\":\"prompt_batch\",\"width\":480,\"height\":864,\"refMaxSize\":864,\"shots\":[{\"id\":\"msn76wqv9v0ne\",\"durationSec\":5,\"prompt\":\"\",\"negativePrompt\":\"bad video\",\"startImage\":{\"imageFile\":\"1f544534d332e0cb5e600f8477aed8d87a2085790fb4879588c7ab12bceb76eb.jpg\",\"width\":728,\"height\":1280},\"endImage\":null}],\"keyframes\":[{\"id\":\"msn76wqv9v0ne